B.b6o=new A.w("church","Passed hand to hand yet never owned; peace lives in my circle. What am I?","The sign of peace")
B.bcI=new A.w("church","Deep riddle #18 \u2014 I am bread and wine yet become something greater in belief. What am I?","Communion")
B.bdp=new A.w("church","Whispered on knees, answered in seasons; I move mountains slowly. What am I?","Prayer")
B.bjt=new A.w("church","Challenge 20: I have no voice but every hymn passes through me. What am I?","A choir loft")
B.beh=new A.w("logic","Deep riddle #21 \u2014 The more you take from me, the larger I become. What am I? (Think carefully.)","A hole")
B.bg6=new A.w("logic","I have cities but no houses, forests but no trees, water but no fish. What am I?","A map")
B.beR=new A.w("logic","I speak without a mouth and hear without ears; I have no body but come alive with wind. What am I?","An echo")
B.b78=new A.w("logic","Deep riddle #24 \u2014 Born tall, I die short; every word I carry shrinks me. What am I?","A candle")
B.beK=new A.w("logic","Challenge 25: I have keys but open no locks; space but no room; enter but not go inside. What am I?","A keyboard")
